## What's in here

This folder is the curated knowledge layer for the **{{PROJECT_NAME}}** project. Each `.md` file is a single entry — a paper, doc, decision, component, pattern, troubleshooting note, or similar. Folders organize entries by category (see the taxonomy below). Entries cross-link via standard markdown links; `_MAP.md` and the `_INDEX.md` files are auto-generated overviews.

